│ and then passed into sound_i2s.                                    │
│ If sound_i2s uses opposite slot ordering relative to the Pocket    │
│ output expectation, this exact symptom appears on both cores.      │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Apply the fix at the shared output stage to correct both GB and │
│    GBC with one change.                                            │
│  • Make the smallest possible change (avoid touching unrelated     │
│    clock/filter logic).                                            │
│  • Keep signal naming and interfaces intact to minimize regression │
│    risk.                                                           │
│  • Do not modify test files or broad refactors.                    │
│                                                                    │
