│                                                                    │
│ In this file, the final filtered channels (audio_l, audio_r) are   │
│ passed to the I2S serializer (sound_i2s). If the serializer’s lane │
│ expectation is opposite to the current connection, both cores      │
│ would exhibit swapped stereo exactly as reported.                  │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
