│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The pipeline flush logic for CSR writes is incomplete: it flushes  │
│ on PMP-related CSR updates only for CSR_OP_WRITE and CSR_OP_SET,   │
│ but not for CSR_OP_CLEAR.                                          │
│                                                                    │
│ As a result, clearing PMP CSRs can change permissions without      │
│ forcing a refetch/recheck of in-flight fetched instructions,       │
│ allowing instructions to proceed with stale PMP checks.            │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is in rtl/ibex_id_stage.sv, inside csr_pipeline_flushes: │
│                                                                    │
│  • Current condition:                                              │
│     • flush-triggering CSRs (mstatus, mie, mseccfg, PMPs) are      │
│       checked only when op is WRITE or SET.                        │
│  • CSR_OP_CLEAR falls through to the debug-CSR-only branch and     │
│    therefore misses PMP flushes.                                   │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep changes minimal and localized to avoid behavioral          │
│    regressions.                                                    │
│  • Preserve existing flush behavior for other CSR classes.         │
│  • Ensure all write-like CSR ops (WRITE, SET, CLEAR) are treated   │
│    consistently for security-sensitive CSRs (PMP/ePMP).            │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Update the flush condition to include CSR_OP_CLEAR in the same     │
│ branch that handles WRITE/SET for CSR_MSTATUS, CSR_MIE,            │
│ CSR_MSECCFG, and PMPs.                                             │
│                                                                    │
