│ to control cache behavior.                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ Current connection:                                                │
│                                                                    │
│  • .icache_enable_i ( icache_enable_i )                            │
│                                                                    │
│ So the cache remains enabled even in debug mode.                   │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Make a minimal behavioral change.                               │
│  • Keep debug-mode override local to IF/cache interface, since     │
│    this is where cache control is applied.                         │
