│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and localized.                          │
│  • Avoid changing global trap machinery when local fault           │
│    mutual-exclusion is sufficient.                                 │
│  • Ensure only one fault class is asserted for the same memory     │
│    operation when priority is architecturally expected.            │
│  • Preserve existing special behavior (e.g., misaligned atomics    │
│    causing access fault under ZICCLSM conditions).                 │
