│  • LoadAccessFaultM / StoreAmoAccessFaultM are also generated      │
│    independently.                                                  │
│  • Nothing suppresses access faults when a misaligned fault is     │
│    already present.                                                │
│                                                                    │
│ So both can assert simultaneously, and downstream trap priority    │
│ may choose access fault first, causing the mismatch.               │
│                                                                    │
