│                                                                    │
│  • Keep changes minimal and localized to fault-source generation.  │
│  • Avoid changing global trap-priority logic when source masking   │
│    can enforce intended precedence.                                │
│  • Preserve existing special-case behavior (e.g., misaligned       │
│    atomics causing access fault under Zicclsm-supported path).     │
│  • Do not alter unrelated modules/tests.                           │
│                                                                    │
