│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue reports tracer anomalies around WFI/interrupt behavior:  │
│                                                                    │
│  • False warning: Attempting to read from uninitialized RAM on an  │
│    MMIO load (GPIO_OUTPUT_VAL) that is actually valid.             │
│  • Confusing MTIP timing in logs around WFI.                       │
│                                                                    │
