│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The failure is a race/collision in the testbench tb_axi_lite_regs: │
│ the per-byte random direct-load generator (toggle_load) can update │
│ reg_q while the directed AXI write/read sanity check is running.   │
│ So the test expects DEADBEEF..., but one or more bytes may already │
│ have been overwritten by random load data (seed-dependent),        │
│ causing nondeterministic assertion failures.                       │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ In test/tb_axi_lite_regs.sv:                                       │
│                                                                    │
│  • proc_generate_axi_traffic does a directed write/read check      │
│    first.                                                          │
│  • proc_generate_direct_load starts all toggle_load() tasks        │
│    immediately after reset.                                        │
│  • toggle_load() continuously asserts reg_load[byte_i] with random │
│    value/timing.                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│ Because both run concurrently right after reset, random direct     │
│ loads can corrupt the register being checked.                      │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the directed sanity check deterministic and isolated.      │
│  • Start randomized background traffic only after deterministic    │
│    checks pass.                                                    │
│  • Make minimal changes and preserve the rest of the stress        │
│    behavior.                                                       │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Add a simple synchronization flag (start_rand_load) to gate random │
│ direct-load activity:                                              │
│                                                                    │
│  • Initialize start_rand_load = 0.                                 │
│  • Set start_rand_load = 1 only after the directed write/read      │
│    assertions.                                                     │
