<code>
1 # Changelog
2 All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
3 
4 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
5 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
6 
7 ## [Unreleased]
8 ### Added
9 - Added support for Hyperbus. pulp_soc now supports booting from HyperFlash memory
10 ### Changed
11 - Increase size of boot_mode signal to 2-bit to accomodate the new Hyperbus bootmode
12 - Bumped riscv_dbg IP Version to 0.4.1
13 - Switched to new AXI CDC IPs between SoC and Cluster
14 - Switched to common cells CDC for cluster event exchange
15 - Bumped axi IP Version to 0.29.1
16 - Reduced latency of APB and AXI transactions
17 - Bumped register interface IP Version to 0.3.1
18 - Bumped cv32e40p IP Version to pulpissimo-v3.4.0-rev3
19 - Bumped udma_core IP version to 1.1.0
20 ### Removed
21 - Removed APB Bus interface from repository. The identical version defined in the APB depedency is now used 
22 - Removed dependency to archived legacy axi_slice_dc
23 ### Fixed
24 - Fixed Genus SystemVerilog incompatibility in soc_interconnect
25 
26 ## [2.1.0] - 2021-02-02
27 ### Added
28 - Added `Bender.yml` file for bender compatibility
29 - Added `obi_pulp_adapter`
30 
31 ### Changed
32 - updated `ibex`
33 - change from deprecated `generic_memory` to `tc_sram` tech cell, bump `tech_cells_generic` accordingly
</code>
