52 ## [2.0.0] - 2020-12-11
53 ### Added
54 - Completely replaced `soc_interconnect` with a new parametric version
55 - Added AXI Crossbar to `soc_interconnect` to attach custom IPs
56 - Added new `pulp_soc` parameter to isolate the axi plug CDC fifo in case it is not needed
57 - Add `register_interface` as dependency to simplify integration of custom ip using reggen
58 - Properly assert `r_opc` signal in new interconnect to indicate bus errors
59 - Add error checking for illegal access on HWPE ports which only have access to L2 interleaved memory
60 ### Changed
61 - AXI ID width of cluster plugs are now set to actually required width instead of a hardcoded one
62 - TCDM protocol to SRAM specific protocol is moved from interconnect to memory bank module
63 ### Removed
64 - obsolete `axi_node` dependency
65 - obsolete header files
66 
67 ## [1.4.2] - 2020-11-04
68 ### Fixed
69 - Propagate `ZFINX` parameter
70 
71 ## [1.4.1] - 2020-10-28
72 ### Changed
73 - Bump `fpnew` to `v0.6.4`
74
