│ different CSID than the previous command.                          │
│ Instead of transitioning into the dedicated CSBSwitch state, the   │
│ FSM goes to WaitIdle, which causes it to effectively skip the      │
│ first command after a CSID change.                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ This means the first command after switching chip select can be    │
│ missed or delayed incorrectly, breaking correct multi-device       │
│ operation.                                                         │
